          "guid": "mt157n1r5mwg6i5h",
          "message": {
            "text": "The end-to-end oracle produced 687 normalized records with an evidence-complete verdict. Every helper discriminator moved (face 1, axes 21, ptem 46, features 167, direction 679, script 110, language 9, buffer flags 2, cluster level 20), all four browser controls moved, and the stage-evidence consumer reported both font-selection and shaping-clusters-glyphs as passed with 687 rows.",
            "markdown": "The end-to-end oracle produced 687 normalized records with an evidence-complete verdict. Every helper discriminator moved (face 1, axes 21, ptem 46, features 167, direction 679, script 110, language 9, buffer flags 2, cluster level 20), all four browser controls moved, and the stage-evidence consumer reported both font-selection and shaping-clusters-glyphs as passed with 687 rows."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "tools/unified-shaping-oracle.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 192,
                  "endLine": 208,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "      const moved = browserControlMovement({ ...controls, paintedOrigins: controls.origin });\n      const browserControls = { face: moved.face, features: moved.features, direction: moved.direction, paintedOrigins: moved.paintedOrigins };\n      const movementProven = exact.movementProven && Object.values(browserControls).every(Boolean);\n      const complete = exact.completeEnvironment && records.length === exact.pairs\n        && records.every((record) => {\n          const chrome = record.chrome as { paintedFaces: PaintedFace[]; paintedOrigins: unknown[] };\n          const helper = record.helper as ExactRecord[\"face\"];\n          const comparison = record.comparison as { faceAgreement: boolean; faceObservation: FaceObservation };\n          return helper.localPostscriptName != null && chrome.paintedOrigins.length > 0\n            && (comparison.faceAgreement || comparison.faceObservation === \"css-unaddressable-after-candidate-walk\");\n        });\n      const report = {\n        schemaVersion: 1,\n        stage: \"face-shaping-painted-origins\",\n        sourceRevision: \"chromium:7d859f271cbda744098ac69f44978d4edfa62be3\",\n        verdict: complete && movementProven && exactRun.status === 0 ? \"evidence-complete\" : \"verdict-withheld\",\n        boundary: \"CDP exposes painted faces and DOM origins, not Blink glyph ids; glyph records come from the same concrete face shaped by Chromium-configured vendored HarfBuzz.\","
                  }
                }
              }
            }
